<DocsLayout
  title="niubash — the AI-native real Bash"
  description="niubash product page: a Rust-built native three-platform bash-compatible shell. Zero-fork three-tier execution, no MSYS, all four path dialects, 83/83 GNU upstream corpora, agent-ready flags and wpm integration."
  path="/en/products/niubash/"
  lang="en"
  enPath="/products/niubash/"
  jsonLdExtra={[productJsonLd, faqJsonLd(productFaq, 'en')]}
  ogImage="/og/niubash.png"
  zhBanner
>
  <header class="doc-head">
    <h1>niubash</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      The AI-native real Bash: real syntax, real Unix commands, native Windows / Linux / macOS.
      One <code>niu.exe</code> packages the language engine (rubash), real Unix commands (WinuxCmd),
      a git-aware prompt and a plugin system with a trust model; it is not MSYS2, Cygwin, Git Bash or
      WSL — no POSIX emulation layer, no path-conversion heuristics.
    </p>
    <div class="badges">
      <span class="p-badge">Rust</span>
      <span class="p-badge">Windows · Linux · macOS</span>
      <span class="p-badge">stable {latestV}</span>
    </div>
    <p class="meta-line">
      <a href="https://github.com/unixwin/niubash" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">github.com/unixwin/niubash ↗</a>
      <span class="dot">·</span> Star {starsN}
      <span class="dot">·</span> latest {latestV} (measured via repo-meta{metaDate ? `, ${metaDate}` : ""})
    </p>
  </header>

  <section>
    <h2 id="why">Why niubash</h2>
    <p>
      Writing Bash on Windows has historically meant one of a few fates: install a whole MSYS
      emulation layer (Git Bash — 440 MB plus an argument-rewriting msys-2.0.dll), boot a Linux VM
      (WSL — paths flip sides), or give up Bash for PowerShell's verb-noun dialect. niubash's answer
      is the fourth road: <strong>a from-scratch Rust engine that executes bash syntax directly</strong>,
      Windows-native as the main battleground, with the same code shipped as portable binaries on
      Linux and macOS.
    </p>
    <details class="zh-fold">
      <summary>中文原文 · Chinese original（4 张卡片 + 论证全文）</summary>
      <div lang="zh-CN">
        <p>
          它能跑真插件、真脚本、真 dotfiles，靠的不是移植 GNU 代码，而是把兼容性当工程对象：
          每一个行为主张都要对 vendored GNU bash-5.3 源码给 file:line 坐标，每一处差异都要双向差分到字节级。
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>零 fork：三层执行模型</strong>——POSIX fork() 在 Win32 没有等价物，MSYS2/Cygwin 只能在 syscall 层伪造它。niu 的引擎 rubash 复刻 fork 的语义而非机制：子壳与命令替换在进程内完成，脚本可观察的一切与 GNU Bash 一致。命令替换类负载实测 13–62x 快于 GNU bash。</li>
          <li><strong>无 MSYS：argv 永不改写</strong>——Git Bash 的 MSYS 运行时会在 spawn 前启发式改写「看起来像路径」的参数；niu 没有 MSYS 运行时：参数进什么，命令就收什么，无咒语可念。</li>
          <li><strong>四大生态的路径方言全收</strong>——Windows 原生（D:\repo、D:/repo）、MSYS/Git Bash 形（/d/repo、/tmp、/usr/bin）、WSL 形（/mnt/d）、Cygwin 形（/cygdrive/d）全部接受且真折叠——既有脚本零修改。</li>
          <li><strong>兼容性是测出来的，不是宣称的</strong>——对 GNU Bash 自己的 83 套上游语料做 true-baseline 双向测量：83/83 通过、82 套逐字节一致；另外全网 2686 仓 / 9701 资产每夜巡检，6336 条真实资产判定原文入仓可回放。</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          路径方言实测矩阵随审计包附上（PATH-MATRIX.md，约 100 条 PS 原生 argv 探针逐格实跑）；
          执行模型细读见 <a href="/en/docs/execution-model/">执行模型：零 fork 三层</a>，
          路径差异见 <a href="/en/docs/paths-and-msys/">路径与 MSYS</a>。
        </p>
      </div>
    </details>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 id="features">Core features</h2>
    <p>
      Real plugins (oh-my-bash, bash-it, bash-completion run unmodified), agent-ready flags
      (<code>--encoded-command</code>, <code>--cwd-state</code>), $SHELL-based agent onboarding,
      12 inlined file commands + 178 applet completions, built-in wpm, a git-aware prompt that
      never spawns git, and console device redirects that work where Git Bash fails outright
      (<code>echo &gt;/dev/tty</code>, <code>exec 3&lt;&gt;/dev/tty</code>, <code>test -e /dev/tty</code>
      — GNU-consistent, which is what keeps git/ssh askpass prompts working). The full ten-point
      list (Chinese):
    </p>
    <details class="zh-fold">
      <summary>中文原文 · Chinese original（十条特性全文）</summary>
      <div lang="zh-CN">
        <ul>
          <li><strong>真·插件生态：上游 BASH 插件直接跑</strong>——oh-my-bash、bash-it、bash-completion、bash-preexec 源码一行不改原生运行；bash-completion 3796 行完整 source rc=0 曾是发布阻塞，如今是端到端门禁的一环。</li>
          <li><strong>为 agent 而设的旗标面</strong>——niu --encoded-command &lt;base64&gt; 给 agent/CI 一条免引号通道；niu --cwd-state &lt;file&gt; 让链式一次性调用共享目录记忆。</li>
          <li><strong>AI agent 接入：$SHELL 即机制</strong>——niu 导出 $SHELL，遵循 POSIX 约定的 agent 从 niu 会话启动即用、零配置；安装器在探针路径布放 bash 启动器命中 Claude Code 的第一探针。</li>
          <li><strong>内联命令与编译进壳的补全</strong>——12 个高频文件命令内联执行，echo | cat 全程零进程；178 个 WinuxCmd applet 的真实旗标补全编译进 shell。</li>
          <li><strong>wpm 联动：命令即包</strong>——rg / fd / bat / jq / node 一条 wpm install 到位；Windows 发行包预装 gawk、niu-git、ripgrep、fd。</li>
          <li><strong>git 感知的快速提示符</strong>——默认提示符读 .git/HEAD 文件（微秒级）渲染分支与脏标记，不再每条提示符 spawn git 子进程（实测 113–362ms）。</li>
          <li><strong>输入管线做到字节级</strong>——多行粘贴自动误执行 186 次 → 0，257 行载荷 300s 超时 → 4.6s；ConPTY 粘贴丢字符、typeahead 吃键、控制台 read 三面逐项与 GNU 行为对齐。</li>
          <li><strong>控制台设备重定向：Git Bash 报错的地方 niu 照跑</strong>——echo &gt;/dev/tty、exec 3&lt;&gt;/dev/tty、test -e /dev/tty 与 GNU 行为一致，同组命令在 Git Bash 的 MSYS 层报 Invalid argument；引擎把 CON 拆成 CONIN$/CONOUT$ 两端，git/ssh askpass 正依赖这条路。</li>
          <li><strong>跨平台到 CI 腿：三个发布平台，六个发布目标</strong>——Windows x64/ARM64、Linux x86_64/aarch64、macOS aarch64/x86_64 六目标每次发布冒烟四查；Android 双目标 incubating，OpenHarmony 仅 CI 编译检查。</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </details>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 id="install">Install &amp; quick start</h2>
    <p>Windows prefers winget (the official Microsoft source; the manifest carries an InstallerSha256 check):</p>
    <div class="cmd">
      <pre><code>{installWinget}</code></pre>
      <CopyButton copy={installWinget} label="Copy" title="Copy to clipboard" />
    </div>
    <p>Or a one-line PowerShell script (no admin required; sets up PATH and a Windows Terminal profile; SHA256 verified):</p>
    <div class="cmd">
      <pre><code>{installWin}</code></pre>
      <CopyButton copy={installWin} label="Copy" title="Copy to clipboard" />
    </div>
    <p class="first-run">
      On Windows the install ships a complete command layer: the full WinuxCmd root (176 Unix commands
      plus the built-in wpm package manager, under <code>&#123;app&#125;\winuxcmd\</code>, PATH pointed at
      <code>winuxcmd\bin</code>), and per <code>preinstall.json</code> preloads gawk (with an awk shim),
      niu-git, ripgrep and fd — git on PATH is native git (~14 ms). Only gawk is x64-only; ARM64
      installs likewise preload niu-git / ripgrep / fd.
    </p>
    <p>Linux / macOS: grab the portable tar.gz and unpack:</p>
    <div class="cmd">
      <pre><code>{installLinux}</code></pre>
      <CopyButton copy={installLinux} label="Copy" title="Copy to clipboard" />
    </div>
    <p>Build from source (Rust 1.95+):</p>
    <div class="cmd">
      <pre><code>{installSource}</code></pre>
      <CopyButton copy={installSource} label="Copy" title="Copy to clipboard" />
    </div>
    <p class="first-run">
      First run of <code>niu</code> starts a setup wizard: prompt theme, completion style and font
      detection, writing pure-bash-syntax <code>~/.niubashrc</code> — afterwards, all configuration is
      that one file.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 id="deep">Deep dive: AI integration, plugins and the prompt</h2>
    <details class="zh-fold">
      <summary>中文原文 · Chinese original（AI 集成 / 插件系统 / 提示符 三节全文）</summary>
      <div lang="zh-CN">
        <p><strong>AI 集成</strong>：agent 的高频调用面是一次性 <code>-c</code>，niu 为此做了三件事。其一，快路径：<code>niu -c true</code> 的冷启动地板从 105.6 ms 压到 26.3 ms（一次性快路径六连 PR；29 例行为电池零差异）。其二，免引号通道 <code>--encoded-command</code>：base64 载荷免掉跨进程引号转义，与 <code>-c</code> 同路径、同 BASH_EXECUTION_STRING 契约。其三，目录记忆 <code>--cwd-state</code>。会话级接入：<strong>从 niu 会话启动的 agent 直接拿到 niu 导出的 $SHELL</strong>。逐家 agent 见 <a href="/en/agents/">AI Agent 接入目录</a>；给 agent 的一键安装提示词见 <a href="/en/ai/">给 AI 的门户</a>；全部旗标语义见 <a href="/en/docs/cli/">CLI 与旗标参考</a>。</p>
        <p><strong>插件系统</strong>：外部 bash 生态走「先装、后审、再信」：<code>niu plugin add</code> 克隆源（新源默认不受信），<code>niu plugin trust</code> 审阅校验和后放行，<code>niu plugin enable</code> 在 rc 尾部维护托管块——块外内容永不改写。声明式 spec（~/.niubash/plugins.toml）是唯一事实源，sync / restore / rollback 一族动词带 lockfile 锁定，镜像（niu plugin mirror）对国内网络友好。运行时信任层会复验 pin。</p>
        <p><strong>提示符</strong>：默认提示符是 Git Bash 骨架，但分支段读 .git/HEAD 文件而不是 fork git——「提示符永不 spawn」红线，实测冷 39 ms / 暖 p50 2.5 ms，对照 Git Bash 每提示符 __git_ps1 约 100–300 ms。PS1 / 主题声明照常接管，set -o vi 的编辑模式指示器保留。</p>
      </div>
    </details>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 id="bench">Measured numbers</h2>
    <p>Every row is a same-machine, reproducible measurement; benchmark scripts ship with the repo. Full comparison on the <a href="/en/benchmarks/">benchmarks page</a>.</p>
    <div class="table-scroll">
